add('modals','Which phrase describes a strong past deduction?',['must have forgotten','must forget','must have forgot'],'must have forgotten','El participio de forget es forgotten.');
add('modals','There is no milk left. Someone ___ it. (Conclusión muy segura)',['must have drunk','must have drank','must drink'],'must have drunk','Drink → drank → drunk. Usa el participio después de have.');
